### 1. post 모듈이 요청한 데이터 전달 내부 api
GET {{baseUrl}}/feed?cursorId=1&size=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. 게시물 단건 조회 
GET {{baseUrl}}/feed/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}